            "cites": [1]
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "text": "Her campaign says she wants to cut taxes, reduce regulations and lower inflation to help small businesses. Davis names affordability as the most important issue facing the district. She says her technology expertise could help oversee artificial intelligence and educate consumers on its benefits. She supports the 2022 Supreme Court ruling that overturned Roe v. Wade and returned abortion regulation to the states. She advocates for parental control in education and wants classrooms to focus on core academics without what she calls ideological agendas. On immigration, she proposes securing the border with advanced technology, enforcing existing laws, prioritizing skilled legal immigrants, and deporting criminal aliens. She also calls for a \"Digital Dome\" national defense program to protect against foreign cyberattacks and online threats. Davis told NBC Chicago she would prioritize her district's interests and is willing to disagree with Donald Trump.",
